     3	Snapshot: **2026-10-14, America/Los_Angeles**. This is a focused public-source review, not an exhaustive priority search. Primary sources support every substantive status statement below. A table gap is reported as a **table gap**, not proof that no recent paper has resolved it. Preprint claims and locally replayed certificates are distinct.
