   194	
   195	The user asked for still-open but not-too-hard problems. This project has **not established that selection criterion**. The seven-qubit route starts behind a 2009 structural obstruction; its remaining feasible LP data lack projector realizability. The eleven-qubit assay was aimed at a genuine unrestricted gap, but the stronger 2019 CWS classification was initially missed. Both the locally tested family and the larger CWS class are already closed. The existence of simulators or fast certificate checkers is not an argument that the remaining problem is easy.
