README.md:9:**The “still-open but not-too-hard” selection criterion was not established.** The seven-qubit CWS obstruction was already proved in 2009. A stronger 2019 exhaustive-CWS result, found during the final prior-art check, also excludes the eleven-qubit target throughout CWS, not merely our tested circulant family. The assay is therefore a restricted reproduction, not research headway on an open class. Known-code reproduction and these family-specific certifications do **not** count as solving the user's requested open target. Small matrices and fast replay do not make the remaining mathematical obligation easy.
