  The four dual SDPs could further be constrained by applying additional constraints
that hold for all quantum codes, namely KBi ≥ Ai and Si ≥ 0, and the additional SDP
variable from Ref. [MNH25][Theorem 22]. However, including these extra conditions did
not lead to stronger bounds for the parameter range (n ≤ 19) considered in this work.

